        a: 'The course is conducted in hybrid mode — offline at Bhartiya Vidya Bhavan – Sardar Patel Institute of Technology (SPIT), Andheri West Campus, Mumbai – 400058, with the option to join online via Google Meet as well.',
      },
      {
        q: 'What happens if I miss a class?',
        a: 'All lectures are recorded and stored on YouTube for on-demand viewing and self-paced learning. Students can use the recorded lectures to revise concepts or catch up on sessions they are unable to attend.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Will I receive assignments and practical exercises?',
        a: 'Yes. Practical exercises and assignments form part of the learning process.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Will I receive study material?',
        a: 'Yes. Study and learning resources are provided as part of the program.',
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'fees',
    title: 'Fees & Enrollment',
    items: [
      {
        q: 'How much does the course cost?',
        a: 'Fee details are shared directly by our admissions team over a call, or in the downloadable brochure (available after email verification). Contact us or download the brochure to know more.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Are installment payments available?',
        a: 'Yes. The course fee can be paid in up to 3 installments. Contact the admissions team for the fee amount and applicable installment schedule.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Do I need to purchase expensive software or AI tools?',
        a: 'No. Students do not need to purchase expensive software or AI tools to participate in the training.',
      },
      {
        q: 'What is the cancellation and refund policy?',
        a: 'There is no cancellation or refund after the training starts. Students are advised to review the course details, schedule, eligibility and fee structure carefully before enrollment.',
      },
      {
        q: 'How can I enroll in the course?',
        a: 'Contact the admissions team for registration, eligibility confirmation, batch availability and payment details.',
      },
      {
        q: 'How can I contact the course team?',
        a: 'Phone: +91 96199 97797 or +91 77188 49238. Students may contact the course team for admissions, fee, schedule and enrollment information.',
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'career',
    title: 'Certification, Career & Placement',
    items: [
      {
        q: 'What certificate will I receive?',
        a: 'Students who successfully complete the training will receive certification from Bhartiya Vidya Bhavan – Sardar Patel Institute of Technology (SPIT).',
      },
      {
        q: 'Is internship provided after the course?',
        a: 'Yes. An internship is guaranteed for every student who successfully completes the training. Internship opportunities shall be provided through SPIT, and may involve SPIT, Utkarsh Minds Technologies or partner companies. The internship may be paid or unpaid depending on the opportunity.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Is placement assistance provided?',
        a: 'Yes. 100% Internship and Placement Assistance is provided through SPIT for all eligible participants who successfully complete the training. Placement assistance means support in accessing and pursuing employment opportunities and does not constitute a guarantee of employment.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Will I receive interview preparation?',
        a: 'Yes. Interview preparation is included in the program as part of the career-readiness component.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Is resume building included?',
        a: 'Yes. Resume building is included as part of the 5-hour Interview Preparation + Resume Building + Soft Skills Training component.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Is soft-skills training included?',
        a: 'Yes. Soft-skills training is included in the 5-hour career-readiness component.',
      },
      {
        q: 'What kind of jobs can I target after completing the course?',
        a: 'Depending on your educational background, skills, projects and interview performance, the course can help prepare you for AI/ML, Data Science, AI development, Generative AI, Agentic AI, Python, Data Analytics, NLP and Computer Vision related opportunities.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Who teaches the course?',
        a: 'The course is delivered through the academic and training ecosystem associated with SPIT and its training partners, with a focus on practical and industry-relevant learning.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Can I suggest additional AI topics?',
        a: 'Students may communicate topics that they believe are important for interviews or career preparation to the course team.',
      },
    ],
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Frequently Asked Questions"
  description="Answers to common questions about the Professional Certification in Artificial Intelligence and Agentic AI — curriculum, schedule, fees, certification, internship and placement."
>
  <Section theme="subtle" class="faq-hero-section">
    <Container>
      <div class="hero-card" data-reveal>
        <p class="kicker">FAQ</p>
        <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

        <nav class="jump-nav" aria-label="Jump to FAQ category">
          {
            groups.map((group) => (
              <a href={`#${group.id}`}>{group.title}</a>
            ))
          }
        </nav>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </Section>

  {
    groups.map((group, i) => (
      <Section theme={i % 2 === 0 ? 'light' : 'subtle'} id={group.id} class="faq-group-section">
        <Container>
          <h2 data-reveal>{group.title}</h2>
          <FAQAccordion items={group.items} class="page-faq-list" />
        </Container>
      </Section>
    ))
  }

  <Section theme="dark" id="faq-contact">
    <Container>
      <div class="cta" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <h2>Still have questions?</h2>
          <p>Reach out to the admissions team for enrollment, fees and batch availability.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="cta-actions">
          <Button href="https://wa.me/919619997797" variant="accent">WhatsApp Us</Button>
          <Button href="tel:+917718849238" variant="outline-white">Call +91 77188 49238</Button>
          <Button href="mailto:pranav.nerurkar@utkarshminds.com" variant="outline-white">
            Email Us
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  :global(.section.faq-hero-section) {
    padding-block: var(--space-10);
  }

  :global(.section.faq-group-section) {
    padding-block: var(--space-12);
  }

  .hero-card {
    background-color: #fff;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-8);
  }

  .kicker {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent-dark);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    max-width: 24ch;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    color: var(--color-primary-light);
  }

  .jump-nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .jump-nav a {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-3);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    transition: var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .jump-nav a:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent-dark);
    background-color: var(--color-bg-subtle);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    :global(.section.faq-hero-section),
    :global(.section.faq-group-section) {
      padding-block: var(--space-8);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero-card {
      padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-4);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    }
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    scroll-margin-top: var(--space-16);
  }

  :global(.page-faq-list) {
    max-width: 860px;
  }

  .cta h2 {
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .cta p {
    color: var(--color-dark-text-muted);
    max-width: 56ch;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }
</style>
